VERSION 0.1
DOMAIN software
INTENT tests-pass
GOAL
  The test suite is green on this revision.
CLAIM unit-tests REQUIRED
  ENSURE unit tests pass
INVARIANT full-suite CRITICAL
  ENSURE no test fails on the revision
VERIFY unit-tests
  USING project.tests
VERIFY full-suite
  USING project.tests
ACCEPT WHEN
  required_claims == VERIFIED
  AND critical_failures == 0
